{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0123_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6faf09d8119315c3e27f13228e90923562a57d48db2451791d1f2b8252e786b4", "ja": "（『アイドルヒーローズ』の評判は上々だ！\nみんな一生懸命演じてくれた甲斐があったな！）", "zh": "（《偶像英雄联盟》大获好评！\n大家那么辛苦演出是值得的！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0123_1001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "5d0e8017c2d151d812720f13ed6e8155e914124a1f4d7c84e9fcda8177384ebc", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さ～ん！　ちょっと\nいいですか？　聞きたいことがあるんですけど～。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生～！\n可以打扰你一下吗？我有事想问你～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0123_1002_p", "source_sha256": "13f9b7062dd069992be106f06a6727343d2b75c0ccc90c0a8f03ae8d5da7c356", "ja": "もちろん、\n俺に答えられることなら、なんでもいいぞ？", "zh": "当然没问题，\n只要我答得上的话，你就尽管问吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0123_1003_016tsu", "source_sha256": "f0c54af0254787faa4fa3ac7dadac526e95a9a1a2af582a5f47e78f1cf9a4e54", "ja": "あの、女の子がこんなに強くて、\nヒーローしてるって、どう思いますか？", "zh": "你对这么厉害、又在当英雄的女生\n有什么感想呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0123_1004_p", "source_sha256": "2bbba7ad9975f5d67ddaac015510d831557848aef44b92364bf64f5dd81859b4", "ja": "どう思う……っていうと？", "zh": "有什么感想……你的意思是？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0123_1005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d75a85301a951e4b8e38ca6d48835b49b321d1382b767b72189f806b8b326078", "ja": "わたしたち、映画の中で片手でミサイル受け止めたり、\nビルを壊したりしてたじゃないですか～。", "zh": "我们几个在电影里，不是可以单手挡下飞弹，\n或是破坏整栋大楼吗～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0123_1006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "fca210fa44dadab4055a92caef57ef994a4a6a2322b4424b836199821f605883", "ja": "でも、どんな雑誌にも「ヒーロー女子がモテモテ！」\nなんて書いてなくて。どうなのかなーって。", "zh": "可是，没有任何杂志写到「女英雄大受欢迎！」\n这类内容，所以我才想问问你的意见。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0123_1007_p", "source_sha256": "d8754ede6b4ba74b86d7ca3655bab91aabf30aae1c3569a10c8e750ca21ab5e4", "ja": "まあ……女の子が読む雑誌では、\nヒーロー特集なんてしないだろうしな……。", "zh": "也是啦……毕竟女生会看的杂志，\n一般是不会有英雄特辑的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0123_1008_p", "source_sha256": "b1ad9eb8ebefe03769e22431fb3d8daf699ff8187ec86c79b1c36fff613fd0f8", "ja": "でも翼、男の子が読む雑誌だと、\nけっこう特集されたりするぞ？", "zh": "不过，翼，一般男生在看的杂志，\n就很常推出这样的特辑喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0123_1009_016tsu", "source_sha256": "53de19293d0dfd32ff1728ca1b5536b7a799c3a2675c31b7b0f658fe608055ee", "ja": "そうなんですか？　でも、そういうのに書いてるのは、\nきっとヒーロー男子のことですよね？", "zh": "是吗？可是，里面的内容\n一定都是在讲男英雄吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0123_1010_p", "source_sha256": "e63e8aebd0decc25bc0a73f733b9de899a2561ed39765c99274893ec7d068d09", "ja": "いやいや、男の子はそういう特集で出てくる、\nカッコイイ女の子に憧れたりするものなんだ。", "zh": "不不不，男生对出现在那类特辑的\n帅气女孩也是抱有憧憬的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0123_1011_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e6a6c70afd0c8f78a717b0862b53539e36519e40ecf2e352109b9f09ef566aab", "ja": "えっ、ホントですか？\nじゃあ、ミサイルとか止めたりしても……？", "zh": "咦？真的吗？\n那么，就算可以挡下飞弹也……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0123_1012_p", "source_sha256": "46d7c0bdf6d22876a3d7b614a8e65aff8ebd83a85ead7f95ae919a6180add7b8", "ja": "ああ、そういう女の子にすごくドキドキしたり、\nときめいたりすると思うぞ？", "zh": "嗯，我觉得也会对那样的女生感到小鹿乱撞\n或心跳加速喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0123_1013_016tsu", "source_sha256": "6adea26b0f011daa665cd847231a8634fa64680d8148a561a2abd5fb25e5d9e3", "ja": "よかった～！　えへへ、それなら安心でーす♪", "zh": "太好了～！嘿嘿，这样我就放心了～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0123_1014_016tsu", "source_sha256": "2695594eca9c20a1f4eb78cf2e5b0566c1a541de888a55c0d74757cb5627b286", "ja": "ちなみに、男の子たちだけじゃなくて……\n{$P$}さんも？", "zh": "顺便问一下，男生们会这样……\n那是不是{$P$}先生也会呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0123_1015_p", "source_sha256": "0cde6aa3d75c08abebfdab1ed4c0b5695ad23e366ecc9664603d7d26754daafa", "ja": "ああ、頑張って戦ってるヒーローたちを見てると、\n胸が熱くなるよ。翼もすごく似合ってたぞ！", "zh": "会啊，看到英雄们奋力战斗的身影，\n会让我感到热血沸腾呢。翼也非常适合这角色喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0123_1016_016tsu", "source_sha256": "5c0d8dd05e58d6c53978d85454723382e94612d74acb9157007b4961fe67be3e", "ja": "本当ですか？\nじゃあ私、またヒーローやりたいです！", "zh": "真的吗？\n那我还想再当英雄！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0123_1017_016tsu", "source_sha256": "7a499cb97fc8d554ed5f427a22a33223d924a9ed9828569b81132fecc94bc133", "ja": "次も頑張っちゃいますから、よろしくお願いしますね！\n{$P$}さん♪", "zh": "我下次也会努力的，再请你多多指教啰！\n{$P$}先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
